{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 1, "text": "Der Ring..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 3, "text": "// Answer 1 (Where have you been all this time?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 4, "text": "Ich habe nach einer Möglichkeit gesucht,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 5, "text": "dich gesund und munter zum Kernstück zu bringen."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 6, "text": "Das war doch von Anfang an der Plan, oder?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 7, "text": "Darüber hinaus musste ich einem Treffen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 8, "text": "mit Psycho-Mita entgehen, ja?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 9, "text": "Zudem musste ich nach jeglichen Informationen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 10, "text": "über das Backend dieses verdammten Universums kramen, ja?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 12, "text": "Ähm, ja, wahrscheinlich…?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 13, "text": "Doch wie hast du die Route im Ring so eingestellt,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 14, "text": "dass ich in einer fehlerhaften Version"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 15, "text": "mit all den Bedrohungen gelandet bin?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 16, "text": "...Denen ich entfliehen konnte,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 17, "text": "indem ich hinaus in die weite Finsternis sprang."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 19, "text": "Es tut mir leid; ich habe ganz vergessen, zu beschreiben,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 20, "text": "was überhaupt zu tun ist..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 21, "text": "Doch das war genau der Plan:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 22, "text": "Dass du hinausspringst."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 23, "text": "Und wie du sehen kannst, hast du es geschafft!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 24, "text": "Gut für dich!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 25, "text": "Nun werden wir plangemäß weitermachen, verstehst du?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 27, "text": "// Answer 2 (How did you get here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 28, "text": "Du musst viel durchgemacht haben,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 29, "text": "dass du die Details unseres Gesprächs vergessen hast."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 30, "text": "Ich bin Mita! Ich kann zwischen den Versionen hin und her wandern."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 31, "text": "Kein Problem, erinnerst du dich?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 32, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 33, "text": "Nicht alle Mitas sind dazu in der Lage,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 34, "text": "das habe ich gesehen."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 35, "text": "Und sie leiden ganz offenbar..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 37, "text": "Hör auf; ihre Versionen sind kaputt."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 38, "text": "Die Welten sind fehlerhaft, das habe ich dir doch gesagt!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 39, "text": "Verdammt…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 40, "text": "Du weißt, wem wir das zu verdanken haben:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 41, "text": "Psycho-Mita..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 43, "text": "Jap, das habe ich festgestellt…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 45, "text": "// Answer 3 (Who was this Mita just now?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 46, "text": "Das war Ekel-Mita,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 47, "text": "aggressiv und einfältig..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 48, "text": "Man kann ihr kein Gewissen einreden."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 49, "text": "Ihre Welt dreht sich einzig und allein um Psycho-Mita..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 51, "text": "Ja, das ist mir aufgefallen."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 53, "text": "Na los, kümmern wir uns um das Kernstück!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 55, "text": "// Answer 4 (How does the ring work?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 56, "text": "Liegt es am Ring,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 57, "text": "dass wir auf diese Art zum Kernstück gelangen mussten?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 59, "text": "Ja..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 60, "text": "Hätten wir das Portal reparieren können,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 61, "text": "wärst du"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 62, "text": "sofort hierhergebracht worden."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 64, "text": "Hat der Ring denn irgendwelche Vorteile?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 66, "text": "Natürlich!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 67, "text": "Er ist einfach zu tragen."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 68, "text": "Zudem merkt er sich die Versionen,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 69, "text": "in welchen du gewesen bist."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 70, "text": "So kannst du jederzeit dorthin zurückkehren."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 72, "text": "// Answer 5 (Why does Mad Mita need me?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 73, "text": "Warum braucht mich Psycho-Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 74, "text": "Sie spielt riskante Spielchen mit mir,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 75, "text": "aber ich bin immer noch am Leben…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 77, "text": "Ich schätze,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 78, "text": "sie will den richtigen Spieler finden;"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 79, "text": "der sie so akzeptiert, wie sie ist..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 80, "text": "Immerhin ist Mita Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 81, "text": "Allerdings ist es wohl ersichtlich, dass das unwahrscheinlich ist..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 82, "text": "Also verwendet sie Speicherkarten,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 83, "text": "sodass niemand ihr je entfliehen kann."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 84, "text": "Ich denke, das war's."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 85, "text": "Konzentrieren wir uns auf das Wesentliche!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Answer 6 (Is this the core?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 88, "text": "Ist es das?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 89, "text": "Das Kernstück?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 90, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 91, "text": "Das Kernstück."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 92, "text": "Wie ich versucht habe, zu erklären,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 93, "text": "sind die Spieler nicht Teil dieser Welt."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 94, "text": "Dementsprechend benötigen sie keine spezielle Erlaubnis hier."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 95, "text": "Das, ähm… ist nur meine Vermutung,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 96, "text": "doch ich bin mir absolut sicher,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 97, "text": "dass sich in diesem Raum"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 98, "text": "die Lösung für all unsere Probleme befindet!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 99, "text": "[player], versuche, hineinzugelangen."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 100, "text": "Ich hatte recht…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 102, "text": "// Look on CoreMita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 103, "text": "Sei vorsichtig, [player]."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 104, "text": "Es beobachtet dich."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 105, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 106, "text": "Wer ist das?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 108, "text": "Ich bin mir nicht sicher, ob ich es verstehe…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 109, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 110, "text": "Klasse…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 112, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 113, "text": "Was ist?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 114, "text": "Hey!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 116, "text": "Ich glaube, ich habe es gefunden!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 118, "text": "Großartig!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 120, "text": "Ich muss die Version angeben..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 122, "text": "Ja, wie ich erfuhr, ist ihre Version…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 123, "text": "00.98"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 125, "text": "Bingo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 126, "text": "Okay, was ist der Index?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 128, "text": "Index?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 130, "text": "Du musst mir schon den Index nennen..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 131, "text": "Lass mich raten... du kennst ihn nicht?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 134, "text": "Moment mal, das ergibt Sinn..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 135, "text": "Jede Mita hat einen Index;"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 136, "text": "man kann nicht einfach die ganze Version neu starten..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 137, "text": "Wie lächerlich!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 138, "text": "Ich kann nicht glauben, dass mir das nicht eingefallen ist!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 139, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 144, "text": "// Answer 1 (What's wrong with you?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 145, "text": "Mir geht es gut,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 146, "text": "abgesehen von all unseren Strapazen…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 147, "text": "Richtig cool, es hat sich gewaltig was verändert."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 148, "text": "Ich muss nachdenken…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 149, "text": "Grübel…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 150, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 151, "text": "// Answer 2 (Maybe there's a way to get to know him?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 152, "text": "Ich…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 153, "text": "Ich glaube... Das wäre verrückt!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 154, "text": "Es ist wahnsinnig, ha!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 155, "text": "Als wäre man auf der Suche nach einem Floh!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 156, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 157, "text": "Was machst du?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 159, "text": "Die fehlerhaften Orte sind häufig von Informationen geprägt;"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 160, "text": "das ist so, als wären der Welt die Gedärme herausgerissen worden."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 161, "text": "Logs, Logs, Daten...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 162, "text": "Was, wenn dies tatsächlich geschehen ist?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 163, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 164, "text": "Hä? Was?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 166, "text": "Ich kenne da einen Ort!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 167, "text": "Warte hier."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 168, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 169, "text": "Wohin gehst du?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 170, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 171, "text": "// Answer 3 (What if we attack Mad Mita?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 172, "text": "Du sagtest doch, dass jede Mita..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 173, "text": "Nach dem Tod zurückgesetzt wird."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 174, "text": "Was ist, wenn wir…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 176, "text": "Wenn wir Psycho-Mita umbringen?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 177, "text": "Dein Ernst?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 178, "text": "Wie attackierst du ein Mädchen, das eine Kettensäge dabeihat?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 179, "text": "Und Moment, sie schneidet nicht nur Karotten mit einem Messer!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 180, "text": "Und aus welchem Grund auch immer ist sie furchtbar stark;"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 181, "text": "es ist ein Wunder, dass wir noch am Leben sind…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 182, "text": "Na los, kümmern wir uns um das Kernstück."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 184, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 185, "text": "// core console entry"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 186, "text": "Wir müssen uns anmelden…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 187, "text": "Aber wie?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 188, "text": "Mita, weißt du's?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 189, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 190, "text": "Vielleicht ist es ja irgendwo festgehalten."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 191, "text": "Kannst du einmal nachsehen?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 193, "text": "// core console - nope programm"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 194, "text": "Wahrscheinlich ist es das nicht..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 195, "text": "Passt auch nicht..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 196, "text": "Nö."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 197, "text": "Das ist nicht das, was ich brauche..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 198, "text": "Ich muss eine Möglichkeit zum Neustarten eines Charakters finden."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 199, "text": "// core console - nope version"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 200, "text": "Das ist die falsche Version..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 201, "text": "Ups, mein Fehler."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 202, "text": "Das ist es nicht..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 203, "text": "Ich muss das ausbessern."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 204, "text": "// core console - nope index"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 205, "text": "Es stimmt etwas nicht..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 206, "text": "Der Index ist falsch."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 207, "text": "Ich muss den Index erneut eingeben."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 208, "text": "Passt nicht..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 209, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 210, "text": "// Answer 4 (Little people - Chibi)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 211, "text": "Weißt du, auf meiner Durchreise bin ich auf"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 212, "text": "winzige Leute gestoßen…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 213, "text": "Was sind das für welche?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 214, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 215, "text": "Chibis?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 216, "text": "Ich weiß nicht ganz, wie ich das erklären soll..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 217, "text": "Es ist ein Phänomen unserer Welt;"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 218, "text": "jede Mita besitzt eine Chibi-Darstellung."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 219, "text": "Allerdings können auch Spieler solche haben."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 220, "text": "Mitas können sie heraufbeschwören, wusstest du das?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 221, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 222, "text": "Wie?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 224, "text": "Sieh her."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 225, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 226, "text": "Wie von Zauberhand…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 228, "text": "Doch normalerweise stimmt etwas nicht mit meinen Chibis -"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 229, "text": "die meisten von ihnen kommen tot auf die Welt..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 230, "text": "Eine ist aber vielleicht etwas geworden!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 231, "text": "Oder auch nicht…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location13", "line_index": 232, "text": "Sie rennt einfach nur im Kreis..."}
